For example, a topic may be flagged if its selected performance summary falls below a configurable threshold.

A declining trend may be shown as an additional warning only when sufficient chronological evidence exists.

Use labels such as:

Needs attention.

Developing.

On track.

Insufficient data.

Document the calculation and thresholds.

